    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That works. Now, we're also looking at segmenting our outreach. We find that for certain demographics—specifically more urban, inner-city audiences—that overly formal language can sometimes feel a bit cold or out of touch. Can you suggest a different version of that same shipping delay response that's more \"casual\" and \"urban-friendly\" to help build better rapport with those customers?",
