      "content": "For those urban audiences, you can try something much more relaxed. How about: \"Hey! Thanks for hitting us up about your order. Totally get that waiting is annoying. Let me check the tracking ASAP and get you the real scoop on when your stuff is gonna land.\" This language is more direct and uses slang, which is more relatable to that demographic. It sounds less like a corporate robot and more like a real person helping out.",
      "source": "target",
